{"id":631,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"知徳体を育む関西大学の中高大一貫教育","feature_description":"関西大学第一中学校は、知育・徳育・体育の調和した人間教育を教育方針に掲げます。併設校の利点を生かしたカリキュラムで基礎的な知識・技能を育て、行事や課外活動、中高大連携講座を通じて視野を広げます。探究型の学習では課題を発見し、考えをまとめて解決する力を養成。学校生活を通して自主性、規律、協同と自治の精神を着実に培います。","clubs":[{"id":11695,"name":"E.S.S.","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/dai-ichi/junior/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14372,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/dai-ichi/junior/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14373,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/dai-ichi/junior/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14374,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/dai-ichi/junior/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14375,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/dai-ichi/junior/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14376,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/dai-ichi/junior/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14377,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/dai-ichi/junior/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14378,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/dai-ichi/junior/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14379,"name":"空手道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/dai-ichi/junior/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14380,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/dai-ichi/junior/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14381,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kansai-u.ac.jp/dai-ichi/junior/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14382,"name":"茶華道部","category